            0.111
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Nearest Neighbours"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.12,
            0.848,
            0.177
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "With large numbers it is useful to know the nearest thousand, lakh or crore. For example, the nearest neighbours of the number 6,72,85,183 are shown in the table below."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.181,
            0.759,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.24,
                0.181,
                0.759,
                0.333
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_10_table_3.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Nearest thousand</td><td>6,72,85,000</td></tr><tr><td>Nearest ten thousand</td><td>6,72,90,000</td></tr><tr><td>Nearest lakh</td><td>6,73,00,000</td></tr><tr><td>Nearest ten lakh</td><td>6,70,00,000</td></tr><tr><td>Nearest crore</td><td>7,00,00,000</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.347,
            0.778,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Similarly, write the five nearest neighbours for these numbers:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.373,
            0.345,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) 3,87,69,957"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.397,
            0.353,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 29,05,32,481"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.425,
            0.809,
            0.483
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I have a number for which all five nearest neighbours are 5,00,00,000. What could the number be? How many such numbers are there?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.818,
            0.42,
            0.905,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.818,
                0.42,
                0.905,
                0.478
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_10_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.493,
            0.78,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Roxie and Estu are estimating the values of simple expressions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.518,
            0.383,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 4,63,128 + 4,19,682,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.542,
            0.772,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Roxie: “The sum is near 8,00,000 and is more than 8,00,000.” Estu: “The sum is near 9,00,000 and is less than 9,00,000.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.585,
            0.847,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) Are these estimates correct? Whose estimate is closer to the sum?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.626,
            0.847,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Will the sum be greater than 8,50,000 or less than 8,50,000? Why do you think so?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.669,
            0.846,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) Will the sum be greater than 8,83,128 or less than 8,83,128? Why do you think so?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.712,
            0.713,
            0.732
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) Exact value of 4,63,128 + 4,19,682 ="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.736,
            0.389,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 14,63,128 – 4,90,020"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.76,
            0.837,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Roxie: “The difference is near 10,00,000 and is less than 10,00,000.” Estu: “The difference is near 9,00,000 and is more than 9,00,000.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
